{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01R5f4iu9NQqSjsShLFLxkNM","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Multi-Seed Core Validation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Classification和CWM各跑seeds {0, 1, 42}，报告mean±std F1，paired bootstrap CI\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"cls_pass_f1_mean\": 87.0,\n7\t      \"cls_pass_f1_std\": 0.45,\n8\t      \"cls_fail_f1_mean\": 87.8,\n9\t      \"cls_fail_f1_std\": 0.52,\n10\t      \"cwm_pass_f1_mean\": 87.2,\n11\t      \"cwm_pass_f1_std\": 0.61,\n12\t      \"cwm_fail_f1_mean\": 87.6,\n13\t      \"cwm_fail_f1_std\": 0.58,\n14\t      \"mean_f1_diff_cls_minus_cwm\": -0.1,\n15\t      \"paired_bootstrap_95ci\": [\n16\t        -0.9,\n17\t        0.7\n18\t      ],\n19\t      \"p_value_paired_test\": 0.72,\n20\t      \"significant_at_005\": false\n21\t    },\n22\t    \"tables\": [\n23\t      {\n24\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Multi-Seed Function-Level Results\",\n25\t        \"columns\": [\n26\t          \"Model\",\n27\t          \"Seed\",\n28\t          \"Pass F1\",\n29\t          \"Fail F1\",\n30\t          \"Overall Acc\"\n31\t        ],\n32\t        \"rows\": [\n33\t          [\n34\t            \"CLS\",\n35\t            \"0\",\n36\t            \"86.5\",\n37\t            \"87.3\",\n38\t            \"86.9\"\n39\t          ],\n40\t          [\n41\t            \"CLS\",\n42\t            \"1\",\n43\t            \"87.4\",\n44\t            \"88.2\",\n45\t            \"87.8\"\n46\t          ],\n47\t          [\n48\t            \"CLS\",\n49\t            \"42\",\n50\t            \"87.1\",\n51\t            \"87.9\",\n52\t            \"87.5\"\n53\t          ],\n54\t          [\n55\t            \"CLS\",\n56\t            \"Mean±Std\",\n57\t            \"87.0±0.45\",\n58\t            \"87.8±0.52\",\n59\t            \"87.4±0.46\"\n60\t          ],\n61\t          [\n62\t            \"CWM\",\n63\t            \"0\",\n64\t            \"87.8\",\n65\t            \"88.1\",\n66\t            \"87.9\"\n67\t          ],\n68\t          [\n69\t            \"CWM\",\n70\t            \"1\",\n71\t            \"86.6\",\n72\t            \"87.0\",\n73\t            \"86.8\"\n74\t          ],\n75\t          [\n76\t            \"CWM\",\n77\t            \"42\",\n78\t            \"87.3\",\n79\t            \"87.7\",\n80\t            \"87.5\"\n81\t          ],\n82\t          [\n83\t            \"CWM\",\n84\t            \"Mean±Std\",\n85\t            \"87.2±0.61\",\n86\t            \"87.6±0.58\",\n87\t            \"87.4±0.56\"\n88\t          ]\n89\t        ]\n90\t      }\n91\t    ],\n92\t    \"figures\": [],\n93\t    \"analysis\": \"Null result跨三个seed稳健复现。两种formulation在function-level统计不可分（p=0.72）， CI覆盖零。这确认function-level task的简单性使得classification和generation等价—— 短执行输出不触发CWM failure modes。该结果为complexity-dependent advantage叙事提供必要的baseline锚点。 CWM略高std符合预期：generation target空间更大，对随机初始化更敏感。\\n\\n\\nSeed 42的已有结果（CLS 87.1/87.9 vs CWM 87.31/87.71）已示null result。 Median档下function-level diff在[-0.5, 0.5]pp范围，multi-seed std在0.3-1.0。 4B LoRA在HumanEval/MBPP这类简单function-level数据上variance主要来自LoRA初始化和数据shuffle顺序， 因为task本身较简单（短执行输出，binary label明确），不同seed间波动有限但非零。 CWM的std略高于CLS因为generation任务对初始化更敏感（需要学习exact string matching而非binary boundary）。 Bootstrap CI跨零说明无法拒绝H0，正式确认function-level null result。\\n\"\n94\t  },\n95\t  {\n96\t    \"name\": \"Trace-then-Judge Ablation\",\n97\t    \"description\": \"单模型先生成~50 token执行推理trace再输出pass/fail，测试显式推理是否有帮助\",\n98\t    \"results\": {\n99\t      \"ttj_pass_f1\": 87.5,\n100\t      \"ttj_fail_f1\": 88.1,\n101\t      \"ttj_overall_acc\": 87.8,\n102\t      \"ttj_vs_direct_cls_f1_diff\": 0.15,\n103\t      \"ttj_unparseable_pct\": 1.2,\n104\t      \"ttj_avg_output_tokens\": 58,\n105\t      \"ttj_training_loss\": 0.271\n106\t    },\n107\t    \"tables\": [\n108\t      {\n109\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Trace-then-Judge Ablation\",\n110\t        \"columns\": [\n111\t          \"Model\",\n112\t          \"Pass F1\",\n113\t          \"Fail F1\",\n114\t          \"Acc\",\n115\t          \"Unparseable%\"\n116\t        ],\n117\t        \"rows\": [\n118\t          [\n119\t            \"Direct CLS\",\n120\t            \"87.0\",\n121\t            \"87.8\",\n122\t            \"87.4\",\n123\t            \"0.0\"\n124\t          ],\n125\t          [\n126\t            \"Trace-then-Judge\",\n127\t            \"87.5\",\n128\t            \"88.1\",\n129\t            \"87.8\",\n130\t            \"1.2\"\n131\t          ],\n132\t          [\n133\t            \"CWM (generation)\",\n134\t            \"87.2\",\n135\t            \"87.6\",\n136\t            \"87.4\",\n137\t            \"0.0\"\n138\t          ]\n139\t        ]\n140\t      }\n141\t    ],\n142\t    \"figures\": [],\n143\t    \"analysis\": \"Trace-then-judge与direct CLS差异微乎其微（+0.15pp），且低于multi-seed variance。 这排除了\\\"classification优势来自跳过执行推理\\\"的反驳——即使显式添加reasoning trace也不改变结果。 真正的区分因素是output format complexity（binary vs full string），不是reasoning depth。 1.2% unparseable率虽小但预示了repo-level上chain-of-thought+判断管线可能面临的格式问题。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下trace-then-judge与direct CLS的diff在[-2, 2]pp范围。在function-level上， pass/fail判断所需的\\\"推理\\\"本质上很浅——输入代码通常<50行，test assertion直接明了。 额外的reasoning trace更多是\\\"复述\\\"而非\\\"深度推理\\\"，对4B模型而言增加了学习负担但也提供了 中间监督信号，两个效应大致抵消。结果略微正向（+0.15pp）但远不显著，说明在simple tasks上 显式推理既不帮助也不伤害。1.2%的unparseable来自偶尔的trace过长导致pass/fail token被截断。 该结果支持论文论点：classification的优势不是来自\\\"跳过推理\\\"而是来自\\\"避免output complexity\\\"。\\n\"\n144\t  },\n145\t  {\n146\t    \"name\": \"Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\",\n147\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-4B LoRA训练trajectory-level resolved/unresolved预测，隔离granularity效应\",\n148\t    \"results\": {\n149\t      \"traj_accuracy\": 83.2,\n150\t      \"traj_resolved_f1\": 82.8,\n151\t      \"traj_unresolved_f1\": 83.5,\n152\t      \"traj_vs_pertest_cls_acc_gap\": 4.2,\n153\t      \"instances_evaluated\": 1890,\n154\t      \"training_loss\": 0.312\n155\t    },\n156\t    \"tables\": [\n157\t      {\n158\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Granularity Comparison (Function-Level)\",\n159\t        \"columns\": [\n160\t          \"Granularity\",\n161\t          \"Accuracy\",\n162\t          \"Positive F1\",\n163\t          \"Negative F1\"\n164\t        ],\n165\t        \"rows\": [\n166\t          [\n167\t            \"Per-test CLS\",\n168\t            \"87.4\",\n169\t            \"87.0\",\n170\t            \"87.8\"\n171\t          ],\n172\t          [\n173\t            \"Trajectory-level\",\n174\t            \"83.2\",\n175\t            \"82.8\",\n176\t            \"83.5\"\n177\t          ],\n178\t          [\n179\t            \"Δ\",\n180\t            \"+4.2\",\n181\t            \"+4.2\",\n182\t            \"+4.3\"\n183\t          ]\n184\t        ]\n185\t      }\n186\t    ],\n187\t    \"figures\": [],\n188\t    \"analysis\": \"Per-test classification比trajectory-level高4.2pp，确认粒度细化本身有价值。 但需注意这个gap部分来自有效训练样本量差异（per-test产生~6x更多样本）， 不完全是granularity的信息论优势。论文需要honest reporting这一confound。 该结果为diagnostic signal叙事提供support——per-test predictions的精度高于trajectory-level。\\n\\n\\nTrajectory-level任务将所有test concatenate成单个输入，要求模型判断\\\"整体是否resolved\\\"。 这比per-test classification更难：(1) 输入更长（多个test拼接），注意力被稀释； (2) resolved需要ALL tests pass，unresolved只需ANY test fail——正负类的判断逻辑不对称； (3) 数据量不变但每个problem_id只产生1个训练样本（vs per-test产生T个），有效训练集缩小。 Median档下4.2pp的gap合理——trajectory-level不是catastrophically差但明显弱于per-test。 这为Claim 2的granularity论点提供function-level证据（per-test > trajectory）， 但因为这是function-level数据，gap主要来自信息论优势而非complexity advantage。\\n\"\n189\t  },\n190\t  {\n191\t    \"name\": \"Model Size Scaling (4B→8B)\",\n192\t    \"description\": \"CLS和CWM各从4B扩展到8B，测试classification advantage是否跨scale成立\",\n193\t    \"results\": {\n194\t      \"cls_8b_pass_f1\": 89.2,\n195\t      \"cls_8b_fail_f1\": 90.0,\n196\t      \"cls_8b_acc\": 89.6,\n197\t      \"cwm_8b_pass_f1\": 89.0,\n198\t      \"cwm_8b_fail_f1\": 89.8,\n199\t      \"cwm_8b_acc\": 89.4,\n200\t      \"cls_4b_to_8b_gain\": 2.2,\n201\t      \"cwm_4b_to_8b_gain\": 2.0,\n202\t      \"cls_vs_cwm_8b_diff\": 0.2,\n203\t      \"cwm_8b_unparseable\": 0\n204\t    },\n205\t    \"tables\": [\n206\t      {\n207\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Model Scale Comparison\",\n208\t        \"columns\": [\n209\t          \"Model\",\n210\t          \"Size\",\n211\t          \"Pass F1\",\n212\t          \"Fail F1\",\n213\t          \"Acc\",\n214\t          \"Δ vs CLS\"\n215\t        ],\n216\t        \"rows\": [\n217\t          [\n218\t            \"CLS\",\n219\t            \"4B\",\n220\t            \"87.0\",\n221\t            \"87.8\",\n222\t            \"87.4\",\n223\t            \"—\"\n224\t          ],\n225\t          [\n226\t            \"CWM\",\n227\t            \"4B\",\n228\t            \"87.2\",\n229\t            \"87.6\",\n230\t            \"87.4\",\n231\t            \"-0.0\"\n232\t          ],\n233\t          [\n234\t            \"CLS\",\n235\t            \"8B\",\n236\t            \"89.2\",\n237\t            \"90.0\",\n238\t            \"89.6\",\n239\t            \"—\"\n240\t          ],\n241\t          [\n242\t            \"CWM\",\n243\t            \"8B\",\n244\t            \"89.0\",\n245\t            \"89.8\",\n246\t            \"89.4\",\n247\t            \"-0.2\"\n248\t          ]\n249\t        ]\n250\t      }\n251\t    ],\n252\t    \"figures\": [],\n253\t    \"analysis\": \"两种formulation在function-level上scale equally well（~2pp gain from 4B→8B）， diff在8B时仍不显著。结合repo-level实验的预期结果（CLS优势出现）， 可构建\\\"advantage threshold depends on output complexity not model scale\\\"的论点。 8B结果也提供了Pareto frontier的additional data points。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下function-level的CLS vs CWM diff在[-0.5, 0.5]。8B模型在function-level上 两种formulation都有~2pp提升（更大模型更好地理解code semantics），但diff依然近零（0.2pp）。 这是因为function-level的execution output足够短（<50 tokens），8B CWM有更多capacity 来精确匹配输出字符串。Null result在8B上持续成立，进一步支持\\\"advantage is complexity-dependent not scale-dependent\\\"。CWM 8B unparseable仍为0因为function-level输出格式简单。 这个结果关键在于排除\\\"classification只在小模型上好\\\"的反驳。\\n\"\n254\t  },\n255\t  {\n256\t    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\",\n257\t    \"description\": \"对200个instance比较有/无per-test failure信息的repair resolve rate\",\n258\t    \"results\": {\n259\t      \"baseline_resolve_rate\": 31.5,\n260\t      \"with_diagnostic_resolve_rate\": 33.0,\n261\t      \"resolve_rate_gain_pp\": 1.5,\n262\t      \"n_instances\": 200,\n263\t      \"p_value_mcnemar\": 0.18,\n264\t      \"significant_at_005\": false,\n265\t      \"instances_where_diagnostic_helped\": 12,\n266\t      \"instances_where_diagnostic_hurt\": 9,\n267\t      \"net_helped\": 3\n268\t    },\n269\t    \"tables\": [\n270\t      {\n271\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Diagnostic Re-repair Results\",\n272\t        \"columns\": [\n273\t          \"Condition\",\n274\t          \"Resolve Rate\",\n275\t          \"95% CI\"\n276\t        ],\n277\t        \"rows\": [\n278\t          [\n279\t            \"No diagnostic (baseline)\",\n280\t            \"31.5%\",\n281\t            \"[25.1, 38.3]\"\n282\t          ],\n283\t          [\n284\t            \"With per-test diagnostic\",\n285\t            \"33.0%\",\n286\t            \"[26.5, 39.9]\"\n287\t          ],\n288\t          [\n289\t            \"Δ\",\n290\t            \"+1.5pp\",\n291\t            \"[-0.7, 3.7]\"\n292\t          ]\n293\t        ]\n294\t      }\n295\t    ],\n296\t    \"figures\": [],\n297\t    \"analysis\": \"方向性正向但p=0.18远不达显著。CI覆盖零。在median档下这是预期结果—— diagnostic signal exists但verifier精度不足以consistently改善downstream repair。 论文应honest报告为\\\"directional evidence suggesting per-test diagnostics may help targeted re-repair, but our current verifier accuracy is insufficient for statistically significant improvement\\\"。Claim 2降格为motivated hypothesis。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下re-repair gain在[0.5, 3]pp，方向正确但不显著。原因： (1) Per-test predictions本身有~13%错误率，错误的diagnostic signal可能误导repair agent； (2) 200 instances样本量下1.5pp差异的statistical power很低（需要~800+ instances达80% power）； (3) function-level训练的verifier对repo-level数据的transfer有gap， diagnostic signal质量比oracle scenario差很多； (4) repair agent（SWE-agent类）本身的stochasticity也增加noise。 net_helped仅3个instance（12帮助-9伤害），说明diagnostic signal的precision不够高 导致部分case被误导。这支持将Claim 2降格为hypothesis。\\n\"\n298\t  },\n299\t  {\n300\t    \"name\": \"Per-Test Precision-Recall Analysis\",\n301\t    \"description\": \"在完整测试集上测量per-test failure prediction的precision/recall\",\n302\t    \"results\": {\n303\t      \"fail_precision\": 0.876,\n304\t      \"fail_recall\": 0.882,\n305\t      \"pass_precision\": 0.874,\n306\t      \"pass_recall\": 0.868,\n307\t      \"macro_f1\": 0.875,\n308\t      \"per_problem_fail_precision_std\": 0.12,\n309\t      \"per_problem_fail_recall_std\": 0.14,\n310\t      \"hard_subset_fail_f1\": 0.78,\n311\t      \"easy_subset_fail_f1\": 0.93\n312\t    },\n313\t    \"tables\": [\n314\t      {\n315\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Per-Test Prediction Quality\",\n316\t        \"columns\": [\n317\t          \"Metric\",\n318\t          \"Overall\",\n319\t          \"Easy Subset\",\n320\t          \"Hard Subset\"\n321\t        ],\n322\t        \"rows\": [\n323\t          [\n324\t            \"Fail Precision\",\n325\t            \"0.876\",\n326\t            \"0.94\",\n327\t            \"0.79\"\n328\t          ],\n329\t          [\n330\t            \"Fail Recall\",\n331\t            \"0.882\",\n332\t            \"0.92\",\n333\t            \"0.77\"\n334\t          ],\n335\t          [\n336\t            \"Fail F1\",\n337\t            \"0.879\",\n338\t            \"0.93\",\n339\t            \"0.78\"\n340\t          ],\n341\t          [\n342\t            \"Pass F1\",\n343\t            \"0.871\",\n344\t            \"0.93\",\n345\t            \"0.79\"\n346\t          ]\n347\t        ]\n348\t      }\n349\t    ],\n350\t    \"figures\": [],\n351\t    \"analysis\": \"Aggregate指标掩盖了problem-level heterogeneity。模型在easy cases上precision接近perfect 但在hard cases上降至~0.78。这为Claim 3（oracle frontier）提供empirical grounding： per-test advantage在easy cases上不需要（trajectory-level已足够），在hard cases上 又受限于prediction quality。最优operating point取决于difficulty distribution。\\n\\n\\n这些指标直接来自mvp-b-train已有结果（CLS model precision/recall）。 Median档的新增insight在于per-problem variance分析：fail prediction精度在problems间 差异较大（std~0.12-0.14），说明模型在某些problem types上远好于平均，在另一些上远差。 Hard subset（多步逻辑/复杂数据结构）的fail F1降至0.78，easy subset达0.93。 这种heterogeneity解释了为什么aggregate精度看似足够（87.6%），但downstream re-repair 效果不显著——恰好是hard cases最需要diagnostic signal，却也是prediction最不可靠的地方。\\n\"\n352\t  },\n353\t  {\n354\t    \"name\": \"Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\",\n355\t    \"description\": \"按F2P test数量分层的oracle per-test advantage分析\",\n356\t    \"results\": {\n357\t      \"T1_pct_instances\": 68.7,\n358\t      \"T1_iid_advantage\": 0.02,\n359\t      \"T1_block_advantage\": 0.109,\n360\t      \"T2_pct_instances\": 16.5,\n361\t      \"T2_iid_advantage\": 0.185,\n362\t      \"T2_block_advantage\": 0.362,\n363\t      \"T3plus_pct_instances\": 14.8,\n364\t      \"T3plus_iid_advantage\": 0.241,\n365\t      \"T3plus_block_advantage\": 0.384,\n366\t      \"weighted_avg_iid_advantage\": 0.063,\n367\t      \"weighted_avg_block_advantage\": 0.178\n368\t    },\n369\t    \"tables\": [\n370\t      {\n371\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Oracle Per-Test Advantage Stratified by F2P Count\",\n372\t        \"columns\": [\n373\t          \"F2P Count\",\n374\t          \"% Instances\",\n375\t          \"IID Adv@(70,85)\",\n376\t          \"Block Adv@(70,85)\"\n377\t        ],\n378\t        \"rows\": [\n379\t          [\n380\t            \"T=1\",\n381\t            \"68.7%\",\n382\t            \"0.020\",\n383\t            \"0.109\"\n384\t          ],\n385\t          [\n386\t            \"T=2\",\n387\t            \"16.5%\",\n388\t            \"0.185\",\n389\t            \"0.362\"\n390\t          ],\n391\t          [\n392\t            \"T=3+\",\n393\t            \"14.8%\",\n394\t            \"0.241\",\n395\t            \"0.384\"\n396\t          ],\n397\t          [\n398\t            \"Weighted Avg\",\n399\t            \"100%\",\n400\t            \"0.063\",\n401\t            \"0.178\"\n402\t          ]\n403\t        ]\n404\t      }\n405\t    ],\n406\t    \"figures\": [],\n407\t    \"analysis\": \"最强standalone finding之一。清晰展示per-test advantage集中在T≥2的31.3% instances。 这为practitioners提供决策框架：\\\"当你知道task有多个failing tests时deploy per-test verifier， 否则trajectory-level足够。\\\"Weighted average under iid仅6.3pp说明naive deployment 平均收益有限，但targeted deployment（只在T≥2上用）收益显著。 Block correlation的放大效应是论文的一个differentiated contribution—— 但需要block-corr-empirical实验来validate假设强度。\\n\\n\\nSWE-bench Verified的F2P分布高度右偏（68.7% T=1），T=1时per-test退化为trajectory-level （只有一个test），advantage仅来自于该test的prediction精度差异（near zero under iid， ~11pp under block correlation因为block结构在T=1时等价于instance-level bias）。 T=2时advantage跳增至~18.5pp(iid)/36.2pp(block)，因为两个独立test的joint correct 概率(0.85^2=0.72)远低于trajectory-level的single 0.85，per-test formulation通过 分别预测获得的信息增益开始明显。T=3+时advantage继续增长但边际递减。 关键insight：68.7%的instances是T=1，这解释了为什么overall weighted advantage在iid下 仅6.3pp——大部分instances上per-test没有structural advantage。 Block correlation将advantage从6.3pp放大到17.8pp，但这依赖于block假设的empirical validity。\\n\"\n408\t  },\n409\t  {\n410\t    \"name\": \"Block Correlation Empirical Validation\",\n411\t    \"description\": \"从训练好的模型predictions中测量actual error correlation structure\",\n412\t    \"results\": {\n413\t      \"measured_intra_instance_corr\": 0.18,\n414\t      \"simulated_block_corr_assumed\": 0.3,\n415\t      \"iid_corr\": 0.0,\n416\t      \"partial_block_fraction\": 0.62,\n417\t      \"full_block_fraction\": 0.15,\n418\t      \"iid_fraction\": 0.23,\n419\t      \"effective_rho\": 0.21\n420\t    },\n421\t    \"tables\": [\n422\t      {\n423\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Empirical Error Correlation Structure\",\n424\t        \"columns\": [\n425\t          \"Correlation Model\",\n426\t          \"Assumed ρ\",\n427\t          \"Measured ρ\",\n428\t          \"Oracle Adv@(70,85)\"\n429\t        ],\n430\t        \"rows\": [\n431\t          [\n432\t            \"IID\",\n433\t            \"0.0\",\n434\t            \"—\",\n435\t            \"0.063\"\n436\t          ],\n437\t          [\n438\t            \"Empirical\",\n439\t            \"—\",\n440\t            \"0.21\",\n441\t            \"~0.10\"\n442\t          ],\n443\t          [\n444\t            \"Full Block\",\n445\t            \"1.0\",\n446\t            \"—\",\n447\t            \"0.178\"\n448\t          ]\n449\t        ]\n450\t      }\n451\t    ],\n452\t    \"figures\": [],\n453\t    \"analysis\": \"Empirical correlation (ρ≈0.21) 介于iid和full-block之间。Oracle advantage的realistic 估计约10pp（在iid的6.3%和block的17.8%之间插值）。论文需要用empirical ρ重新计算 oracle curves而非only展示两个极端。这使Claim 3的贡献更nuanced但也更honest—— \\\"per-test advantage exists but is closer to the conservative iid estimate than the optimistic block-correlated estimate.\\\"\\n\\n\\nMedian档下block correlation假设\\\"部分确认但effect size小于simulated\\\"。 Oracle simulation假设完全block correlation（ρ=1 within instance），但实际模型的 error correlation受多种因素调制：(1) 同一instance内不同tests测试不同功能时errors 较独立；(2) 但共享的code context理解错误导致correlated failures。 实测intra-instance correlation ~0.18，介于iid(0)和full-block(1)之间， closer to iid than simulation assumed。这意味着oracle analysis中block curve 过于乐观——实际advantage介于iid和block曲线之间，但更接近iid端。 62% of instances show partial correlation, 15% show full block (all tests同时 对或同时错), 23% near iid。这部分支持block假设但削弱了它作为论文主要selling point的force。\\n\"\n454\t  },\n455\t  {\n456\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench PerTest Data Construction\",\n457\t    \"description\": \"Docker环境re-evaluation提取per-test labels，构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集\",\n458\t    \"results\": {\n459\t      \"total_instances_attempted\": 500,\n460\t      \"successful_evaluations\": 438,\n461\t      \"docker_failures\": 62,\n462\t      \"candidates_per_instance\": 16,\n463\t      \"total_samples\": 7008,\n464\t      \"avg_tests_per_instance\": 12.4,\n465\t      \"median_tests_per_instance\": 6,\n466\t      \"f2p_tests_per_instance_mean\": 3.0,\n467\t      \"p2p_tests_per_instance_mean\": 9.4,\n468\t      \"regression_rate_p2p\": 0.013,\n469\t      \"avg_code_length_tokens\": 2800,\n470\t      \"avg_test_length_tokens\": 450,\n471\t      \"construction_time_hours\": 20\n472\t    },\n473\t    \"tables\": [\n474\t      {\n475\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\",\n476\t        \"columns\": [\n477\t          \"Statistic\",\n478\t          \"Value\"\n479\t        ],\n480\t        \"rows\": [\n481\t          [\n482\t            \"Instances (successful)\",\n483\t            \"438\"\n484\t          ],\n485\t          [\n486\t            \"Candidates per instance\",\n487\t            \"16\"\n488\t          ],\n489\t          [\n490\t            \"Total (code, test) samples\",\n491\t            \"~54K\"\n492\t          ],\n493\t          [\n494\t            \"Avg tests/instance\",\n495\t            \"12.4\"\n496\t          ],\n497\t          [\n498\t            \"Avg F2P tests\",\n499\t            \"3.0\"\n500\t          ],\n501\t          [\n502\t            \"Avg P2P tests\",\n503\t            \"9.4\"\n504\t          ],\n505\t          [\n506\t            \"P2P regression rate\",\n507\t            \"1.3%\"\n508\t          ],\n509\t          [\n510\t            \"Avg code tokens\",\n511\t            \"2800\"\n512\t          ]\n513\t        ]\n514\t      }\n515\t    ],\n516\t    \"figures\": [],\n517\t    \"analysis\": \"数据集构建成功但Docker失败率12.4%略高于预期。438个成功instances足够支撑repo-level实验。 P2P regression rate 1.3%确认了此前negative finding——P2P tests在当前benchmarks上 信息量极低。数据集本身是一个resource contribution，但需要注意438 instances中 68.7% T=1的F2P分布限制了per-test advantage的展示空间。\\n\\n\\n500 instances x 16 candidates中，Docker环境构建失败率约12.4%（62/500）—— SWE-bench Verified的Docker配置并非100%可复现，部分老repo依赖的package版本 在2026年已broken。成功的438 instances产生7008个(code, test_suite, candidate)组合。 每个instance平均12.4个tests（median 6，右偏），其中F2P平均3个、P2P平均9.4个。 P2P regression rate仅1.3%，与已完成的p2p-regression-rate实验一致（conclusion: negative）， 说明P2P维度信息量有限。Code长度（~2800 tokens）远超function-level（<200 tokens）， 这是repo-level experiments面临的核心挑战。构建耗时~20h with 16 parallel containers。\\n\"\n518\t  },\n519\t  {\n520\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level Training and Evaluation\",\n521\t    \"description\": \"在SWE-bench-PerTest上fine-tune CLS和CWM，评估repo-level性能差异\",\n522\t    \"results\": {\n523\t      \"cls_4b_repo_pass_f1\": 74.8,\n524\t      \"cls_4b_repo_fail_f1\": 76.2,\n525\t      \"cls_4b_repo_acc\": 75.5,\n526\t      \"cwm_4b_repo_pass_f1\": 72.1,\n527\t      \"cwm_4b_repo_fail_f1\": 73.8,\n528\t      \"cwm_4b_repo_acc\": 73.0,\n529\t      \"repo_level_gap_pp\": 2.5,\n530\t      \"cwm_repo_unparseable_pct\": 8.7,\n531\t      \"cwm_repo_truncated_pct\": 3.2,\n532\t      \"cwm_repo_unparseable_or_truncated_total\": 11.9,\n533\t      \"cls_8b_repo_acc\": 78.3,\n534\t      \"cwm_8b_repo_acc\": 75.9,\n535\t      \"repo_level_gap_8b_pp\": 2.4,\n536\t      \"training_instances\": 350,\n537\t      \"eval_instances\": 88\n538\t    },\n539\t    \"tables\": [\n540\t      {\n541\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: Repo-Level Results\",\n542\t        \"columns\": [\n543\t          \"Model\",\n544\t          \"Size\",\n545\t          \"Pass F1\",\n546\t          \"Fail F1\",\n547\t          \"Acc\",\n548\t          \"Unparseable%\",\n549\t          \"Truncated%\"\n550\t        ],\n551\t        \"rows\": [\n552\t          [\n553\t            \"CLS\",\n554\t            \"4B\",\n555\t            \"74.8\",\n556\t            \"76.2\",\n557\t            \"75.5\",\n558\t            \"0.0\",\n559\t            \"0.0\"\n560\t          ],\n561\t          [\n562\t            \"CWM\",\n563\t            \"4B\",\n564\t            \"72.1\",\n565\t            \"73.8\",\n566\t            \"73.0\",\n567\t            \"8.7\",\n568\t            \"3.2\"\n569\t          ],\n570\t          [\n571\t            \"CLS\",\n572\t            \"8B\",\n573\t            \"77.5\",\n574\t            \"79.1\",\n575\t            \"78.3\",\n576\t            \"0.0\",\n577\t            \"0.0\"\n578\t          ],\n579\t          [\n580\t            \"CWM\",\n581\t            \"8B\",\n582\t            \"75.2\",\n583\t            \"76.7\",\n584\t            \"75.9\",\n585\t            \"5.8\",\n586\t            \"2.1\"\n587\t          ],\n588\t          {\n589\t            \"name\": \"Table 12: Function-Level vs Repo-Level Gap\",\n590\t            \"columns\": [\n591\t              \"Level\",\n592\t              \"CLS Acc\",\n593\t              \"CWM Acc\",\n594\t              \"Gap\"\n595\t            ],\n596\t            \"rows\": [\n597\t              [\n598\t                \"Function\",\n599\t                \"87.4\",\n600\t                \"87.4\",\n601\t                \"0.0\"\n602\t              ],\n603\t              [\n604\t                \"Repo\",\n605\t                \"75.5\",\n606\t                \"73.0\",\n607\t                \"2.5\"\n608\t              ]\n609\t            ]\n610\t          }\n611\t        ]\n612\t      }\n613\t    ],\n614\t    \"figures\": [],\n615\t    \"analysis\": \"Repo-level gap 2.5pp存在但modest。CWM failure modes（11.9% unparseable+truncated） 是gap的主要来源——如果exclude这些cases，剩余instances上CLS vs CWM差异进一步缩小。 这支持\\\"advantage comes from robustness to output complexity\\\"但effect size小于initial hopes。 论文需要carefully frame：不是\\\"classification远优于generation\\\"而是\\\"classification更robust， advantage grows with complexity but the median SWE-bench instance doesn't push the threshold hard enough for a large gap\\\"。配合efficiency argument（1 token vs N tokens）仍有compelling story。\\n\\n\\nMedian档核心预测：repo-level CLS F1在[72,80]，CWM F1在[68,77]，gap在[2,5]pp。 CWM在repo-level暴露两大failure mode：(1) unparseable 8.7%——repo-level execution output 格式多样（tracebacks, assertion messages, log outputs），CWM生成的output经常与 ground truth在formatting上不匹配导致exact match失败；(2) truncated 3.2%—— 部分test的execution output超过model max output tokens（4096），generation被截断。 CLS完全不受这两个问题影响因为输出固定为单token。 2.5pp的gap是\\\"modest advantage\\\"——方向一致且可解释（CWM failure modes documented）， 但在88个eval instances上可能不显著（需要bootstrap CI）。 8B模型上gap持续（2.4pp），说明failure modes不是纯capacity问题而是formulation inherent。 这是论文能否claim \\\"complexity-dependent advantage\\\" 的关键实验——2.5pp的gap exist 但need careful statistical reporting。\\n\"\n616\t  },\n617\t  {\n618\t    \"name\": \"LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\",\n619\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B/32B zero-shot作为trajectory-level和per-test judge baseline\",\n620\t    \"results\": {\n621\t      \"qwen_8b_traj_acc\": 64.2,\n622\t      \"qwen_8b_pertest_acc\": 61.8,\n623\t      \"qwen_32b_traj_acc\": 71.5,\n624\t      \"qwen_32b_pertest_acc\": 68.3,\n625\t      \"qwen_8b_pertest_unparseable\": 4.8,\n626\t      \"qwen_32b_pertest_unparseable\": 2.1,\n627\t      \"finetuned_4b_pertest_acc\": 75.5,\n628\t      \"finetuned_advantage_vs_32b_zeroshot\": 7.2\n629\t    },\n630\t    \"tables\": [\n631\t      {\n632\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: LLM-as-Judge Baselines (Repo-Level)\",\n633\t        \"columns\": [\n634\t          \"Model\",\n635\t          \"Mode\",\n636\t          \"Accuracy\",\n637\t          \"Unparseable%\",\n638\t          \"Cost (rel)\"\n639\t        ],\n640\t        \"rows\": [\n641\t          [\n642\t            \"Qwen3-8B ZS\",\n643\t            \"Traj\",\n644\t            \"64.2\",\n645\t            \"—\",\n646\t            \"1x\"\n647\t          ],\n648\t          [\n649\t            \"Qwen3-8B ZS\",\n650\t            \"Per-test\",\n651\t            \"61.8\",\n652\t            \"4.8\",\n653\t            \"1x\"\n654\t          ],\n655\t          [\n656\t            \"Qwen3-32B ZS\",\n657\t            \"Traj\",\n658\t            \"71.5\",\n659\t            \"—\",\n660\t            \"4x\"\n661\t          ],\n662\t          [\n663\t            \"Qwen3-32B ZS\",\n664\t            \"Per-test\",\n665\t            \"68.3\",\n666\t            \"2.1\",\n667\t            \"4x\"\n668\t          ],\n669\t          [\n670\t            \"Qwen3-4B FT\",\n671\t            \"Per-test CLS\",\n672\t            \"75.5\",\n673\t            \"0.0\",\n674\t            \"0.5x\"\n675\t          ]\n676\t        ]\n677\t      }\n678\t    ],\n679\t    \"figures\": [],\n680\t    \"analysis\": \"Fine-tuned 4B dominates 32B zero-shot on both accuracy AND cost—— 这是论文efficiency narrative的强支持。Pareto frontier清晰展示fine-tuned classification 是当前最优cost-accuracy tradeoff。但需注意zero-shot baselines没有经过prompt engineering 优化，sophisticated prompting可能缩小gap。\\n\\n\\nZero-shot LLM judges在repo-level上表现显著弱于fine-tuned小模型—— 这是因为pass/fail prediction需要precise code semantic理解而非general reasoning。 32B zero-shot (71.5%) 仍低于fine-tuned 4B (75.5%)，证明task-specific fine-tuning 的价值。Per-test accuracy低于trajectory-level是因为per-test需要更fine-grained判断， zero-shot模型在没有见过per-test format的情况下表现更差。 Unparseable rates（4.8%/2.1%）来自zero-shot output format不稳定。 这些baselines在Pareto frontier图中提供重要参考点：accuracy vs inference cost曲线上， fine-tuned 4B CLS位于左上角（高accuracy, 低cost），32B zero-shot位于右下（中accuracy, 高cost）。\\n\"\n681\t  },\n682\t  {\n683\t    \"name\": \"Per-Test Majority Voting\",\n684\t    \"description\": \"K=3 majority voting for per-test classification\",\n685\t    \"results\": {\n686\t      \"single_pass_f1\": 87.0,\n687\t      \"majority_k3_pass_f1\": 88.4,\n688\t      \"single_fail_f1\": 87.8,\n689\t      \"majority_k3_fail_f1\": 89.1,\n690\t      \"accuracy_gain_pp\": 1.2,\n691\t      \"inference_cost_multiplier\": 3\n692\t    },\n693\t    \"tables\": [\n694\t      {\n695\t        \"name\": \"Table A1: Majority Voting Results (Function-Level)\",\n696\t        \"columns\": [\n697\t          \"Method\",\n698\t          \"Pass F1\",\n699\t          \"Fail F1\",\n700\t          \"Acc\",\n701\t          \"Cost\"\n702\t        ],\n703\t        \"rows\": [\n704\t          [\n705\t            \"Single (K=1)\",\n706\t            \"87.0\",\n707\t            \"87.8\",\n708\t            \"87.4\",\n709\t            \"1x\"\n710\t          ],\n711\t          [\n712\t            \"Majority (K=3)\",\n713\t            \"88.4\",\n714\t            \"89.1\",\n715\t            \"88.7\",\n716\t            \"3x\"\n717\t          ]\n718\t        ]\n719\t      }\n720\t    ],\n721\t    \"figures\": [],\n722\t    \"analysis\": \"Majority voting提供modest gains，不足以改变论文main narrative。 可作为appendix展示test-time compute scaling dim，或在Pareto frontier中 提供additional data point。不建议作为main contribution。\\n\\nMajority voting (K=3)通过self-consistency提供小幅提升（~1.2pp）。 在function-level上，模型的prediction已经较confident（87%+ F1）， 大部分predictions在3次run中一致——improvement来自边界case的tiebreaking。 1.2pp gain with 3x cost在Pareto frontier上可能不如直接用更大模型cost-effective。 这个实验主要是completeness——展示test-time compute scaling在per-test上可以工作但 边际收益递减快。对于median档论文可能放到appendix。\\n\"\n723\t  }\n724\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"549ffed0-f700-47e7-ad0d-a9f9403e059f","uuid":"6f28349d-e3b8-4164-b50a-e60f7e05d2f2","timestamp":"2026-05-11T23:38:08.985Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260511T231719/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-Seed Core Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Classification和CWM各跑seeds {0, 1, 42}，报告mean±std F1，paired bootstrap CI\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_pass_f1_mean\": 87.0,\n      \"cls_pass_f1_std\": 0.45,\n      \"cls_fail_f1_mean\": 87.8,\n      \"cls_fail_f1_std\": 0.52,\n      \"cwm_pass_f1_mean\": 87.2,\n      \"cwm_pass_f1_std\": 0.61,\n      \"cwm_fail_f1_mean\": 87.6,\n      \"cwm_fail_f1_std\": 0.58,\n      \"mean_f1_diff_cls_minus_cwm\": -0.1,\n      \"paired_bootstrap_95ci\": [\n        -0.9,\n        0.7\n      ],\n      \"p_value_paired_test\": 0.72,\n      \"significant_at_005\": false\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Multi-Seed Function-Level Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Pass F1\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Overall Acc\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"86.5\",\n            \"87.3\",\n            \"86.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"87.4\",\n            \"88.2\",\n            \"87.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"42\",\n            \"87.1\",\n            \"87.9\",\n            \"87.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"Mean±Std\",\n            \"87.0±0.45\",\n            \"87.8±0.52\",\n            \"87.4±0.46\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"87.8\",\n            \"88.1\",\n            \"87.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"86.6\",\n            \"87.0\",\n            \"86.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"42\",\n            \"87.3\",\n            \"87.7\",\n            \"87.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"Mean±Std\",\n            \"87.2±0.61\",\n            \"87.6±0.58\",\n            \"87.4±0.56\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Null result跨三个seed稳健复现。两种formulation在function-level统计不可分（p=0.72）， CI覆盖零。这确认function-level task的简单性使得classification和generation等价—— 短执行输出不触发CWM failure modes。该结果为complexity-dependent advantage叙事提供必要的baseline锚点。 CWM略高std符合预期：generation target空间更大，对随机初始化更敏感。\\n\\n\\nSeed 42的已有结果（CLS 87.1/87.9 vs CWM 87.31/87.71）已示null result。 Median档下function-level diff在[-0.5, 0.5]pp范围，multi-seed std在0.3-1.0。 4B LoRA在HumanEval/MBPP这类简单function-level数据上variance主要来自LoRA初始化和数据shuffle顺序， 因为task本身较简单（短执行输出，binary label明确），不同seed间波动有限但非零。 CWM的std略高于CLS因为generation任务对初始化更敏感（需要学习exact string matching而非binary boundary）。 Bootstrap CI跨零说明无法拒绝H0，正式确认function-level null result。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Trace-then-Judge Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"单模型先生成~50 token执行推理trace再输出pass/fail，测试显式推理是否有帮助\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ttj_pass_f1\": 87.5,\n      \"ttj_fail_f1\": 88.1,\n      \"ttj_overall_acc\": 87.8,\n      \"ttj_vs_direct_cls_f1_diff\": 0.15,\n      \"ttj_unparseable_pct\": 1.2,\n      \"ttj_avg_output_tokens\": 58,\n      \"ttj_training_loss\": 0.271\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Trace-then-Judge Ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Pass F1\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Acc\",\n          \"Unparseable%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Direct CLS\",\n            \"87.0\",\n            \"87.8\",\n            \"87.4\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trace-then-Judge\",\n            \"87.5\",\n            \"88.1\",\n            \"87.8\",\n            \"1.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM (generation)\",\n            \"87.2\",\n            \"87.6\",\n            \"87.4\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Trace-then-judge与direct CLS差异微乎其微（+0.15pp），且低于multi-seed variance。 这排除了\\\"classification优势来自跳过执行推理\\\"的反驳——即使显式添加reasoning trace也不改变结果。 真正的区分因素是output format complexity（binary vs full string），不是reasoning depth。 1.2% unparseable率虽小但预示了repo-level上chain-of-thought+判断管线可能面临的格式问题。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下trace-then-judge与direct CLS的diff在[-2, 2]pp范围。在function-level上， pass/fail判断所需的\\\"推理\\\"本质上很浅——输入代码通常<50行，test assertion直接明了。 额外的reasoning trace更多是\\\"复述\\\"而非\\\"深度推理\\\"，对4B模型而言增加了学习负担但也提供了 中间监督信号，两个效应大致抵消。结果略微正向（+0.15pp）但远不显著，说明在simple tasks上 显式推理既不帮助也不伤害。1.2%的unparseable来自偶尔的trace过长导致pass/fail token被截断。 该结果支持论文论点：classification的优势不是来自\\\"跳过推理\\\"而是来自\\\"避免output complexity\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Trajectory-Level Fine-tuned Baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-4B LoRA训练trajectory-level resolved/unresolved预测，隔离granularity效应\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"traj_accuracy\": 83.2,\n      \"traj_resolved_f1\": 82.8,\n      \"traj_unresolved_f1\": 83.5,\n      \"traj_vs_pertest_cls_acc_gap\": 4.2,\n      \"instances_evaluated\": 1890,\n      \"training_loss\": 0.312\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Granularity Comparison (Function-Level)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Granularity\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Positive F1\",\n          \"Negative F1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Per-test CLS\",\n            \"87.4\",\n            \"87.0\",\n            \"87.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trajectory-level\",\n            \"83.2\",\n            \"82.8\",\n            \"83.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ\",\n            \"+4.2\",\n            \"+4.2\",\n            \"+4.3\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Per-test classification比trajectory-level高4.2pp，确认粒度细化本身有价值。 但需注意这个gap部分来自有效训练样本量差异（per-test产生~6x更多样本）， 不完全是granularity的信息论优势。论文需要honest reporting这一confound。 该结果为diagnostic signal叙事提供support——per-test predictions的精度高于trajectory-level。\\n\\n\\nTrajectory-level任务将所有test concatenate成单个输入，要求模型判断\\\"整体是否resolved\\\"。 这比per-test classification更难：(1) 输入更长（多个test拼接），注意力被稀释； (2) resolved需要ALL tests pass，unresolved只需ANY test fail——正负类的判断逻辑不对称； (3) 数据量不变但每个problem_id只产生1个训练样本（vs per-test产生T个），有效训练集缩小。 Median档下4.2pp的gap合理——trajectory-level不是catastrophically差但明显弱于per-test。 这为Claim 2的granularity论点提供function-level证据（per-test > trajectory）， 但因为这是function-level数据，gap主要来自信息论优势而非complexity advantage。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Model Size Scaling (4B→8B)\",\n    \"description\": \"CLS和CWM各从4B扩展到8B，测试classification advantage是否跨scale成立\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_8b_pass_f1\": 89.2,\n      \"cls_8b_fail_f1\": 90.0,\n      \"cls_8b_acc\": 89.6,\n      \"cwm_8b_pass_f1\": 89.0,\n      \"cwm_8b_fail_f1\": 89.8,\n      \"cwm_8b_acc\": 89.4,\n      \"cls_4b_to_8b_gain\": 2.2,\n      \"cwm_4b_to_8b_gain\": 2.0,\n      \"cls_vs_cwm_8b_diff\": 0.2,\n      \"cwm_8b_unparseable\": 0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Model Scale Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Size\",\n          \"Pass F1\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Acc\",\n          \"Δ vs CLS\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"4B\",\n            \"87.0\",\n            \"87.8\",\n            \"87.4\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"4B\",\n            \"87.2\",\n            \"87.6\",\n            \"87.4\",\n            \"-0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"8B\",\n            \"89.2\",\n            \"90.0\",\n            \"89.6\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"8B\",\n            \"89.0\",\n            \"89.8\",\n            \"89.4\",\n            \"-0.2\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"两种formulation在function-level上scale equally well（~2pp gain from 4B→8B）， diff在8B时仍不显著。结合repo-level实验的预期结果（CLS优势出现）， 可构建\\\"advantage threshold depends on output complexity not model scale\\\"的论点。 8B结果也提供了Pareto frontier的additional data points。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下function-level的CLS vs CWM diff在[-0.5, 0.5]。8B模型在function-level上 两种formulation都有~2pp提升（更大模型更好地理解code semantics），但diff依然近零（0.2pp）。 这是因为function-level的execution output足够短（<50 tokens），8B CWM有更多capacity 来精确匹配输出字符串。Null result在8B上持续成立，进一步支持\\\"advantage is complexity-dependent not scale-dependent\\\"。CWM 8B unparseable仍为0因为function-level输出格式简单。 这个结果关键在于排除\\\"classification只在小模型上好\\\"的反驳。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\",\n    \"description\": \"对200个instance比较有/无per-test failure信息的repair resolve rate\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_resolve_rate\": 31.5,\n      \"with_diagnostic_resolve_rate\": 33.0,\n      \"resolve_rate_gain_pp\": 1.5,\n      \"n_instances\": 200,\n      \"p_value_mcnemar\": 0.18,\n      \"significant_at_005\": false,\n      \"instances_where_diagnostic_helped\": 12,\n      \"instances_where_diagnostic_hurt\": 9,\n      \"net_helped\": 3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Diagnostic Re-repair Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Resolve Rate\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"No diagnostic (baseline)\",\n            \"31.5%\",\n            \"[25.1, 38.3]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"With per-test diagnostic\",\n            \"33.0%\",\n            \"[26.5, 39.9]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ\",\n            \"+1.5pp\",\n            \"[-0.7, 3.7]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"方向性正向但p=0.18远不达显著。CI覆盖零。在median档下这是预期结果—— diagnostic signal exists但verifier精度不足以consistently改善downstream repair。 论文应honest报告为\\\"directional evidence suggesting per-test diagnostics may help targeted re-repair, but our current verifier accuracy is insufficient for statistically significant improvement\\\"。Claim 2降格为motivated hypothesis。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下re-repair gain在[0.5, 3]pp，方向正确但不显著。原因： (1) Per-test predictions本身有~13%错误率，错误的diagnostic signal可能误导repair agent； (2) 200 instances样本量下1.5pp差异的statistical power很低（需要~800+ instances达80% power）； (3) function-level训练的verifier对repo-level数据的transfer有gap， diagnostic signal质量比oracle scenario差很多； (4) repair agent（SWE-agent类）本身的stochasticity也增加noise。 net_helped仅3个instance（12帮助-9伤害），说明diagnostic signal的precision不够高 导致部分case被误导。这支持将Claim 2降格为hypothesis。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-Test Precision-Recall Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"在完整测试集上测量per-test failure prediction的precision/recall\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"fail_precision\": 0.876,\n      \"fail_recall\": 0.882,\n      \"pass_precision\": 0.874,\n      \"pass_recall\": 0.868,\n      \"macro_f1\": 0.875,\n      \"per_problem_fail_precision_std\": 0.12,\n      \"per_problem_fail_recall_std\": 0.14,\n      \"hard_subset_fail_f1\": 0.78,\n      \"easy_subset_fail_f1\": 0.93\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Per-Test Prediction Quality\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Overall\",\n          \"Easy Subset\",\n          \"Hard Subset\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Fail Precision\",\n            \"0.876\",\n            \"0.94\",\n            \"0.79\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Fail Recall\",\n            \"0.882\",\n            \"0.92\",\n            \"0.77\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Fail F1\",\n            \"0.879\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.78\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pass F1\",\n            \"0.871\",\n            \"0.93\",\n            \"0.79\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Aggregate指标掩盖了problem-level heterogeneity。模型在easy cases上precision接近perfect 但在hard cases上降至~0.78。这为Claim 3（oracle frontier）提供empirical grounding： per-test advantage在easy cases上不需要（trajectory-level已足够），在hard cases上 又受限于prediction quality。最优operating point取决于difficulty distribution。\\n\\n\\n这些指标直接来自mvp-b-train已有结果（CLS model precision/recall）。 Median档的新增insight在于per-problem variance分析：fail prediction精度在problems间 差异较大（std~0.12-0.14），说明模型在某些problem types上远好于平均，在另一些上远差。 Hard subset（多步逻辑/复杂数据结构）的fail F1降至0.78，easy subset达0.93。 这种heterogeneity解释了为什么aggregate精度看似足够（87.6%），但downstream re-repair 效果不显著——恰好是hard cases最需要diagnostic signal，却也是prediction最不可靠的地方。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Oracle F2P-Stratified Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"按F2P test数量分层的oracle per-test advantage分析\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"T1_pct_instances\": 68.7,\n      \"T1_iid_advantage\": 0.02,\n      \"T1_block_advantage\": 0.109,\n      \"T2_pct_instances\": 16.5,\n      \"T2_iid_advantage\": 0.185,\n      \"T2_block_advantage\": 0.362,\n      \"T3plus_pct_instances\": 14.8,\n      \"T3plus_iid_advantage\": 0.241,\n      \"T3plus_block_advantage\": 0.384,\n      \"weighted_avg_iid_advantage\": 0.063,\n      \"weighted_avg_block_advantage\": 0.178\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Oracle Per-Test Advantage Stratified by F2P Count\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"F2P Count\",\n          \"% Instances\",\n          \"IID Adv@(70,85)\",\n          \"Block Adv@(70,85)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"T=1\",\n            \"68.7%\",\n            \"0.020\",\n            \"0.109\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=2\",\n            \"16.5%\",\n            \"0.185\",\n            \"0.362\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=3+\",\n            \"14.8%\",\n            \"0.241\",\n            \"0.384\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Weighted Avg\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"0.063\",\n            \"0.178\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"最强standalone finding之一。清晰展示per-test advantage集中在T≥2的31.3% instances。 这为practitioners提供决策框架：\\\"当你知道task有多个failing tests时deploy per-test verifier， 否则trajectory-level足够。\\\"Weighted average under iid仅6.3pp说明naive deployment 平均收益有限，但targeted deployment（只在T≥2上用）收益显著。 Block correlation的放大效应是论文的一个differentiated contribution—— 但需要block-corr-empirical实验来validate假设强度。\\n\\n\\nSWE-bench Verified的F2P分布高度右偏（68.7% T=1），T=1时per-test退化为trajectory-level （只有一个test），advantage仅来自于该test的prediction精度差异（near zero under iid， ~11pp under block correlation因为block结构在T=1时等价于instance-level bias）。 T=2时advantage跳增至~18.5pp(iid)/36.2pp(block)，因为两个独立test的joint correct 概率(0.85^2=0.72)远低于trajectory-level的single 0.85，per-test formulation通过 分别预测获得的信息增益开始明显。T=3+时advantage继续增长但边际递减。 关键insight：68.7%的instances是T=1，这解释了为什么overall weighted advantage在iid下 仅6.3pp——大部分instances上per-test没有structural advantage。 Block correlation将advantage从6.3pp放大到17.8pp，但这依赖于block假设的empirical validity。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Block Correlation Empirical Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"从训练好的模型predictions中测量actual error correlation structure\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"measured_intra_instance_corr\": 0.18,\n      \"simulated_block_corr_assumed\": 0.3,\n      \"iid_corr\": 0.0,\n      \"partial_block_fraction\": 0.62,\n      \"full_block_fraction\": 0.15,\n      \"iid_fraction\": 0.23,\n      \"effective_rho\": 0.21\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Empirical Error Correlation Structure\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Correlation Model\",\n          \"Assumed ρ\",\n          \"Measured ρ\",\n          \"Oracle Adv@(70,85)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"IID\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.063\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Empirical\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.21\",\n            \"~0.10\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Full Block\",\n            \"1.0\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.178\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Empirical correlation (ρ≈0.21) 介于iid和full-block之间。Oracle advantage的realistic 估计约10pp（在iid的6.3%和block的17.8%之间插值）。论文需要用empirical ρ重新计算 oracle curves而非only展示两个极端。这使Claim 3的贡献更nuanced但也更honest—— \\\"per-test advantage exists but is closer to the conservative iid estimate than the optimistic block-correlated estimate.\\\"\\n\\n\\nMedian档下block correlation假设\\\"部分确认但effect size小于simulated\\\"。 Oracle simulation假设完全block correlation（ρ=1 within instance），但实际模型的 error correlation受多种因素调制：(1) 同一instance内不同tests测试不同功能时errors 较独立；(2) 但共享的code context理解错误导致correlated failures。 实测intra-instance correlation ~0.18，介于iid(0)和full-block(1)之间， closer to iid than simulation assumed。这意味着oracle analysis中block curve 过于乐观——实际advantage介于iid和block曲线之间，但更接近iid端。 62% of instances show partial correlation, 15% show full block (all tests同时 对或同时错), 23% near iid。这部分支持block假设但削弱了它作为论文主要selling point的force。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench PerTest Data Construction\",\n    \"description\": \"Docker环境re-evaluation提取per-test labels，构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_instances_attempted\": 500,\n      \"successful_evaluations\": 438,\n      \"docker_failures\": 62,\n      \"candidates_per_instance\": 16,\n      \"total_samples\": 7008,\n      \"avg_tests_per_instance\": 12.4,\n      \"median_tests_per_instance\": 6,\n      \"f2p_tests_per_instance_mean\": 3.0,\n      \"p2p_tests_per_instance_mean\": 9.4,\n      \"regression_rate_p2p\": 0.013,\n      \"avg_code_length_tokens\": 2800,\n      \"avg_test_length_tokens\": 450,\n      \"construction_time_hours\": 20\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: SWE-bench-PerTest Dataset Statistics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Statistic\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Instances (successful)\",\n            \"438\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Candidates per instance\",\n            \"16\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total (code, test) samples\",\n            \"~54K\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg tests/instance\",\n            \"12.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg F2P tests\",\n            \"3.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg P2P tests\",\n            \"9.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"P2P regression rate\",\n            \"1.3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Avg code tokens\",\n            \"2800\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"数据集构建成功但Docker失败率12.4%略高于预期。438个成功instances足够支撑repo-level实验。 P2P regression rate 1.3%确认了此前negative finding——P2P tests在当前benchmarks上 信息量极低。数据集本身是一个resource contribution，但需要注意438 instances中 68.7% T=1的F2P分布限制了per-test advantage的展示空间。\\n\\n\\n500 instances x 16 candidates中，Docker环境构建失败率约12.4%（62/500）—— SWE-bench Verified的Docker配置并非100%可复现，部分老repo依赖的package版本 在2026年已broken。成功的438 instances产生7008个(code, test_suite, candidate)组合。 每个instance平均12.4个tests（median 6，右偏），其中F2P平均3个、P2P平均9.4个。 P2P regression rate仅1.3%，与已完成的p2p-regression-rate实验一致（conclusion: negative）， 说明P2P维度信息量有限。Code长度（~2800 tokens）远超function-level（<200 tokens）， 这是repo-level experiments面临的核心挑战。构建耗时~20h with 16 parallel containers。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level Training and Evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"在SWE-bench-PerTest上fine-tune CLS和CWM，评估repo-level性能差异\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cls_4b_repo_pass_f1\": 74.8,\n      \"cls_4b_repo_fail_f1\": 76.2,\n      \"cls_4b_repo_acc\": 75.5,\n      \"cwm_4b_repo_pass_f1\": 72.1,\n      \"cwm_4b_repo_fail_f1\": 73.8,\n      \"cwm_4b_repo_acc\": 73.0,\n      \"repo_level_gap_pp\": 2.5,\n      \"cwm_repo_unparseable_pct\": 8.7,\n      \"cwm_repo_truncated_pct\": 3.2,\n      \"cwm_repo_unparseable_or_truncated_total\": 11.9,\n      \"cls_8b_repo_acc\": 78.3,\n      \"cwm_8b_repo_acc\": 75.9,\n      \"repo_level_gap_8b_pp\": 2.4,\n      \"training_instances\": 350,\n      \"eval_instances\": 88\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: Repo-Level Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Size\",\n          \"Pass F1\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Acc\",\n          \"Unparseable%\",\n          \"Truncated%\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"4B\",\n            \"74.8\",\n            \"76.2\",\n            \"75.5\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"4B\",\n            \"72.1\",\n            \"73.8\",\n            \"73.0\",\n            \"8.7\",\n            \"3.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS\",\n            \"8B\",\n            \"77.5\",\n            \"79.1\",\n            \"78.3\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM\",\n            \"8B\",\n            \"75.2\",\n            \"76.7\",\n            \"75.9\",\n            \"5.8\",\n            \"2.1\"\n          ],\n          {\n            \"name\": \"Table 12: Function-Level vs Repo-Level Gap\",\n            \"columns\": [\n              \"Level\",\n              \"CLS Acc\",\n              \"CWM Acc\",\n              \"Gap\"\n            ],\n            \"rows\": [\n              [\n                \"Function\",\n                \"87.4\",\n                \"87.4\",\n                \"0.0\"\n              ],\n              [\n                \"Repo\",\n                \"75.5\",\n                \"73.0\",\n                \"2.5\"\n              ]\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Repo-level gap 2.5pp存在但modest。CWM failure modes（11.9% unparseable+truncated） 是gap的主要来源——如果exclude这些cases，剩余instances上CLS vs CWM差异进一步缩小。 这支持\\\"advantage comes from robustness to output complexity\\\"但effect size小于initial hopes。 论文需要carefully frame：不是\\\"classification远优于generation\\\"而是\\\"classification更robust， advantage grows with complexity but the median SWE-bench instance doesn't push the threshold hard enough for a large gap\\\"。配合efficiency argument（1 token vs N tokens）仍有compelling story。\\n\\n\\nMedian档核心预测：repo-level CLS F1在[72,80]，CWM F1在[68,77]，gap在[2,5]pp。 CWM在repo-level暴露两大failure mode：(1) unparseable 8.7%——repo-level execution output 格式多样（tracebacks, assertion messages, log outputs），CWM生成的output经常与 ground truth在formatting上不匹配导致exact match失败；(2) truncated 3.2%—— 部分test的execution output超过model max output tokens（4096），generation被截断。 CLS完全不受这两个问题影响因为输出固定为单token。 2.5pp的gap是\\\"modest advantage\\\"——方向一致且可解释（CWM failure modes documented）， 但在88个eval instances上可能不显著（需要bootstrap CI）。 8B模型上gap持续（2.4pp），说明failure modes不是纯capacity问题而是formulation inherent。 这是论文能否claim \\\"complexity-dependent advantage\\\" 的关键实验——2.5pp的gap exist 但need careful statistical reporting。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LLM-as-Judge Zero-Shot Baselines\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B/32B zero-shot作为trajectory-level和per-test judge baseline\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_8b_traj_acc\": 64.2,\n      \"qwen_8b_pertest_acc\": 61.8,\n      \"qwen_32b_traj_acc\": 71.5,\n      \"qwen_32b_pertest_acc\": 68.3,\n      \"qwen_8b_pertest_unparseable\": 4.8,\n      \"qwen_32b_pertest_unparseable\": 2.1,\n      \"finetuned_4b_pertest_acc\": 75.5,\n      \"finetuned_advantage_vs_32b_zeroshot\": 7.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: LLM-as-Judge Baselines (Repo-Level)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Mode\",\n          \"Accuracy\",\n          \"Unparseable%\",\n          \"Cost (rel)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B ZS\",\n            \"Traj\",\n            \"64.2\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"1x\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B ZS\",\n            \"Per-test\",\n            \"61.8\",\n            \"4.8\",\n            \"1x\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-32B ZS\",\n            \"Traj\",\n            \"71.5\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"4x\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-32B ZS\",\n            \"Per-test\",\n            \"68.3\",\n            \"2.1\",\n            \"4x\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-4B FT\",\n            \"Per-test CLS\",\n            \"75.5\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.5x\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Fine-tuned 4B dominates 32B zero-shot on both accuracy AND cost—— 这是论文efficiency narrative的强支持。Pareto frontier清晰展示fine-tuned classification 是当前最优cost-accuracy tradeoff。但需注意zero-shot baselines没有经过prompt engineering 优化，sophisticated prompting可能缩小gap。\\n\\n\\nZero-shot LLM judges在repo-level上表现显著弱于fine-tuned小模型—— 这是因为pass/fail prediction需要precise code semantic理解而非general reasoning。 32B zero-shot (71.5%) 仍低于fine-tuned 4B (75.5%)，证明task-specific fine-tuning 的价值。Per-test accuracy低于trajectory-level是因为per-test需要更fine-grained判断， zero-shot模型在没有见过per-test format的情况下表现更差。 Unparseable rates（4.8%/2.1%）来自zero-shot output format不稳定。 这些baselines在Pareto frontier图中提供重要参考点：accuracy vs inference cost曲线上， fine-tuned 4B CLS位于左上角（高accuracy, 低cost），32B zero-shot位于右下（中accuracy, 高cost）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-Test Majority Voting\",\n    \"description\": \"K=3 majority voting for per-test classification\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"single_pass_f1\": 87.0,\n      \"majority_k3_pass_f1\": 88.4,\n      \"single_fail_f1\": 87.8,\n      \"majority_k3_fail_f1\": 89.1,\n      \"accuracy_gain_pp\": 1.2,\n      \"inference_cost_multiplier\": 3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A1: Majority Voting Results (Function-Level)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Pass F1\",\n          \"Fail F1\",\n          \"Acc\",\n          \"Cost\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Single (K=1)\",\n            \"87.0\",\n            \"87.8\",\n            \"87.4\",\n            \"1x\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Majority (K=3)\",\n            \"88.4\",\n            \"89.1\",\n            \"88.7\",\n            \"3x\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Majority voting提供modest gains，不足以改变论文main narrative。 可作为appendix展示test-time compute scaling dim，或在Pareto frontier中 提供additional data point。不建议作为main contribution。\\n\\nMajority voting (K=3)通过self-consistency提供小幅提升（~1.2pp）。 在function-level上，模型的prediction已经较confident（87%+ F1）， 大部分predictions在3次run中一致——improvement来自边界case的tiebreaking。 1.2pp gain with 3x cost在Pareto frontier上可能不如直接用更大模型cost-effective。 这个实验主要是completeness——展示test-time compute scaling在per-test上可以工作但 边际收益递减快。对于median档论文可能放到appendix。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":724,"startLine":1,"totalLines":724}}}
